  "notes": "The National Shipping Company of Saudi Arabia (Bahri; ticker 4030) audited consolidated financial statements for the year ended 31 December 2025 with FY2024 comparatives, from the full audited PDF in the 'Annual / 2025' cell of the Saudi Exchange company-profile 'Financial Statements' tab (Resources/fsPdf/439_0_2026-03-17...). Auditor: Ernst & Young Professional Services. The Board of Directors approved the consolidated financial statements in their meeting held on 21 Ramadan 1447H, corresponding to 10 March 2026 (Note 33). Amounts are presented in thousands of Saudi Riyals (scale 1000). The five primary statements (printed FS pages 6-10) are scanned images in the filed PDF (transcribed from page renders at 2.6x); the notes are digital text. Consolidated group with non-controlling interests; no discontinued operations. other_operating_revenue is the 'Bunker subsidy' - a government fuel subsidy presented between 'Gross profit before bunker subsidy' and the reported 'Gross profit'; gross_profit is the reported 'Gross profit' line (after the bunker subsidy). impairment_charges is the 'Provision on trade receivables and contract assets' line. other_income is the 'Other income' line (FY2024 includes a large gain on disposal of vessels). operating_income is the reported 'Operating profit'; finance_costs is 'Finance cost'; finance_income is 'Finance income'; share_of_profit_associates is 'Share of results of equity accounted investees' (Bahri's chemical-tanker and dry-bulk JVs). income_before_income_taxes_and_zakat is 'Profit before Zakat and income tax'; income_taxes_and_zakat is the single 'Zakat and income tax' line. construction_in_progress is 'Projects under construction' (newbuild vessels); long_term_investments is 'Other non-current financial assets'; additional_paid_in_capital is 'Share premium'. long_term_debt / current_debt are the non-current and current 'Loans and borrowings'; lease_liabilities_noncurrent / lease_liabilities_current are the non-current / current lease liabilities. defined_benefit_obligation is 'Employees' end of service benefits'; other_noncurrent_liabilities is the non-current 'Other liabilities'; accounts_payable is 'Trade and other payables'; zakat_payable is 'Provision for Zakat and income tax'. short_term_investments is 'Short term deposits'. depreciation_amortization sums 'Depreciation of property and equipment', 'Depreciation of right-of-use assets' and 'Amortization of intangible assets' from the cash-flow statement. capex sums 'Additions of property and equipment' and 'Additions of projects under construction' (the bulk of Bahri's investing outflow is newbuild vessel construction). interest_paid is 'Finance cost paid'; zakat_paid is 'Zakat and income tax paid'; dividends_paid is 'Dividends paid to equity holders of the parent' (a separate SAR 120,000 / 60,000 thousand went to non-controlling interests). The cash-flow closing balance equals the balance-sheet 'Cash and cash equivalents' line exactly. Statement page references are the printed FS page numbers: financial position 6, profit or loss 7, comprehensive income 8, changes in equity 9, cash flows 9.",
